# pan/bi: SSA allocator
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/39804 state=closed
# This is a port of the SSA allocator from agx plus some adaptations to make it work in pan. The biggest is the handling of constrained (fixed/tied registers) instructions for which I added another way of shuffling the register file.

LCRA is still usable through a flag so we can switch back quickly if required minus the changes to spilling.

There's two commits which will need to get squashed with the following one. I left them separate for now since it might help with reviewing.
